title: "n-epi"
abstract: >-
  A comprehensive, open-source epidemiology, biostatistics, and clinical research
  platform for study design, data analysis, grant writing, manuscript preparation,
  and critical appraisal. Built as a static web application with no runtime
  dependencies.
